<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Our records indicate you have an upcoming flight with Qantas and your preapproved medical clearance stored on your frequent flyer profile has expired.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
If you would like us to update your medical clearance on your profile, please have your treating doctor complete the <a href="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/pdfs/fly/specific-needs/qantas-medical-clearance-guidelines.pdf">Travel Clearance Form</a> (PDF) for assessment in consultation with Qantas Medical Services, at least 5 days prior to travel.  &nbsp;<br />
<br />
If you require oxygen, please have your treating doctor complete PART B section 1 Cardiopulmonary.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Once completed, please upload document and submit the <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/specific-needs.html">Accessibility, Medical and Inclusive Requests</a>&nbsp;form. &nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;</body>
